{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\"feel\":\"一种很郑重却还无处落定的牵挂：人已经知道这里有不能轻轻放过的东西，却还说不清自己究竟在求什么。靠近、迟疑和再次试探同时成立，短暂的确定也不足以让人真正安心。\",\"thread\":\"此刻能够确定的首先不是答案，而是这件事的分量。它已经重要到使人不能干脆放下，却还没有清楚到可以变成一个明确的要求；因此每次觉得自己似乎抓住了一点，都还需要重新辨认，而不能立刻把那一点当成全部。这里的不安不是因为已经失去了什么，而是因为重要性先出现了，理解却还没有跟上。\",\"used\":\"无\",\"new\":[\"已经确立了一件事：有某种重要的需要或牵挂存在，即使它的具体内容还没有被分清。\",\"最初得到的任何确定都还不够完整，因此靠近它本身会伴随继续辨认，而不是立刻安定。\"],\"unexplained\":\"还不能说明这份重要的牵挂具体指向什么，也不能判断它最终需要的是获得、确认、承受还是放下。\"}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "baac89b4-be2f-47a7-bb51-39973578184b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T215808063764Z", "elapsed_seconds": 49.578, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T21:58:57.644789+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ec03114aeedf335667d71f9c00fc45bdd9f362b21d36513c61b3be8605d950a3", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f45828